                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3a256559-f19d-3235-a715-082c2f0c2708",
                        "entry_id": "ed7e238f-633f-33a6-a734-f601d4ddd108",
                        "glosses": [
                            "past passive perfective participle of разду́ть (razdútʹ)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "form-of",
                            "participle",
                            "passive",
                            "past",
                            "perfective"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3a966e5-a5be-43d0-b46f-55685ad1cbd8",
                                "sense_id": "3a256559-f19d-3235-a715-082c2f0c2708",
                                "text": "В двена́дцатом часу́ но́чи пода́ли у́жин, состоя́вший из куска́ ста́рого, сухо́го сы́ру и каки́х-то холо́дных пирожко́в с ру́бленой ветчино́й, кото́рые мне показа́лись вкусне́е вся́ких паште́тов; вина́ была́ всего́ одна́ буты́лка, и та кака́я-то стра́нная: тёмная, с разду́тым го́рлышком, и вино́ в ней отдава́ло ро́зовой кра́ской: впро́чем, его́ никто́ не пил.",
                                "translation": "At twelve o'clock at night, supper was served, consisting of a piece of stale dry cheese, and some cold turnovers of minced ham, which seemed to me more delicious than any pastry I had ever tasted; there was only one bottle of wine, and that was a strange one; a dark-coloured bottle with a wide neck, and the wine in it was of a pink hue; no one drank it, however.",
                                "english": "At twelve o'clock at night, supper was served, consisting of a piece of stale dry cheese, and some cold turnovers of minced ham, which seemed to me more delicious than any pastry I had ever tasted; there was only one bottle of wine, and that was a strange one; a dark-coloured bottle with a wide neck, and the wine in it was of a pink hue; no one drank it, however."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
